  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 104.19 Public facility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 104.19 “Public facility” means “public facility” as defined in RSA 149-M:4, XVIII, namely “one whose permit is held by a town or other governmental unit or agency or political subdivision of the state, or a combination thereof.”\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100) #8460-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #14103, effective 10-23-24 (formerly Env-Sw 104.16) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
